weavec1 — Weave Stage 1 (WIR-written) Compiler
Copyright 2026 Jukka Aho

This product includes software developed as the WIR-written Stage 1
compiler for the Weave programming language. It is built by weavec0
(the Stage 0 hand-written LLVM-IR seed compiler) and emits LLVM IR.

Upstream:  https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec1
Dependency: https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec0 (pinned via WEAVEC0_TAG)
